        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Version 1.4.2]]></title>
            <link>https://Iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2</link>
            <guid>https://Iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2</guid>
            <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Network optimization has been improved, and commands have been added]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Network optimization has been improved, and commands have been added</p>
<!-- -->
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="network-optimization">Network optimization<a href="https://iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2#network-optimization" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Network optimization" title="Direct link to Network optimization" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>The transmission of the <code>WellRested</code> packet has been improved, slightly reducing network traffic</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="new-commands">New commands<a href="https://iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/26/version-1-4-2#new-commands" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to New commands" title="Direct link to New commands" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Added support for the <code>/midnightthoughts reload</code> command,
which performs a hot reload of the configuration without requiring a server restart</p>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-warning admonition_xJq3 alert alert--warning"><div class="admonitionHeading_Gvgb"><span class="admonitionIcon_Rf37"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.893 1.5c-.183-.31-.52-.5-.887-.5s-.703.19-.886.5L.138 13.499a.98.98 0 0 0 0 1.001c.193.31.53.501.886.501h13.964c.367 0 .704-.19.877-.5a1.03 1.03 0 0 0 .01-1.002L8.893 1.5zm.133 11.497H6.987v-2.003h2.039v2.003zm0-3.004H6.987V5.987h2.039v4.006z"></path></svg></span>warning</div><div class="admonitionContent_BuS1"><p>This applies only to the config. A full restart is required when modifying custom achievements or slides</p></div></div>]]></content:encoded>
            <category>update</category>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Version 1.4.1]]></title>
            <link>https://Iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/11/version-1-4-1</link>
            <guid>https://Iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/11/version-1-4-1</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[New UI themes, full Spanish support, and server optimization fixes.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>New UI themes, full Spanish support, and server optimization fixes.</p>
<!-- -->
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="new-ui">New UI<a href="https://iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/11/version-1-4-1#new-ui" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to New UI" title="Direct link to New UI" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Reworked <strong>Vanilla</strong> and <strong>Classic</strong> themes, and added two brand new ones — <strong>Magic</strong> and <strong>Tech</strong>.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="added-spanish">Added Spanish<a href="https://iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/11/version-1-4-1#added-spanish" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Added Spanish" title="Direct link to Added Spanish" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Full Spanish support including custom facts, nightmares, and all overlay text.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="server-optimisation-fixes">Server optimisation fixes<a href="https://iliiasik.github.io/MThoughts-Wiki/blog/2026/06/11/version-1-4-1#server-optimisation-fixes" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Server optimisation fixes" title="Direct link to Server optimisation fixes" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Various server-side performance improvements.</p>]]></content:encoded>
